# Third-Party Notices

The prebuilt native libraries in `internal/ffi/lib/` statically link the
third-party Rust crates listed below. Each section names a license, the
crates distributed under it, and the license text. This file is generated by
`cargo about` from `Cargo.lock` and is regenerated by `scripts/build-ffi.sh`
whenever the native libraries are rebuilt; do not edit it by hand.

Go dependencies are consumed as source by the Go toolchain and are not
redistributed by this repository; their licenses are recorded in `go.sum`'s
module versions and on pkg.go.dev.

